flowchart TB
    User[Owner and Authorized Operator]
    Policy[Governance and Permission Profiles]
    ModelGateway[Provider-Independent Model Gateway]
    Agent[Specialist Agent Runtime]
    Tools[Scoped Tool Adapters]
    Intent[Typed Order Intent]
    Risk[Independent RiskEngine]
    OMS[OMS]
    EGW[Execution Gateway]
    Broker[Broker Dealing API]
    Audit[Immutable Audit and Decision Trace]

    User --> Policy
    Policy --> Agent
    ModelGateway <--> Agent
    Agent --> Tools
    Agent --> Intent
    Intent --> Risk
    Risk -->|Authorized only| OMS
    OMS --> EGW
    EGW --> Broker
    Agent --> Audit
    Tools --> Audit
    Risk --> Audit

    Agent -. cannot bypass .-> EGW
    Agent -. cannot modify .-> Policy
    Agent -. cannot authorize itself .-> Risk
